DESCRIPTION:Billie  Lee  is a writer\, producer\, actress\, comedian\, tr
 ansgender activist\, and champion of food sustainability and equity. LogoTV
  honored Billie in the 2018 Logo30 for raising awareness for the trans comm
 unity. She is a long-time vegan and creator of the popular blog\, She's So 
 Vegan. Billie is best known as a personality from the show Vanderpump Rules
 . Billie's book Why Are You So Sensitive? being published by Simon and Shus
 ter\, will be released in May 2024.\n\nManagement reserves the right to pre
 vent customers from entering the facility who they deem disruptive or dange
 rous to other patrons.\nMore info: https://comedyatlas.app/comedy-atlas/eve
